ed(0)} KB, ${r.files} source files)`);\n}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011AXNghJcBZQMFX4HiKHeWL","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
