{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghQJrbu9tpnZ74mxsCa7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VpuUnq81qdrWuizioexoCm","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-225453__x8def6b/work/AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-225453/.src/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff; grep -n \"particles.add\\|particles.bits\\|particles.dust\\|particles.glints\\|particles.ring\\|particles.text\\|lights.add\\|lights.ambient\\|lights.tint\\|game.flash\\|r.glowDisc\\|r.groundRing\\|r.groundDisc\\|r.decal\\|px.blend\\|px.ell\\b\\|px.ell(\" API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-330 | head -24","description":"Look up particles, lights and decal APIs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4594,"cache_read_input_tokens":404811,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4594},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8aedb0d-fc32-4598-b2c3-8a34e0c85184","uuid":"f127c028-3442-48fe-892b-9904dafdb739","timestamp":"2026-11-04T06:19:56.869Z","request_id":"req_011CghQJrN1b3D6DPsJqLYH1","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01VpuUnq81qdrWuizioexoCm":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-225453__x8def6b/work/AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-225453/.src/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff; grep -n \"particles.add\\|particles.bits\\|particles.dust\\|particles.glints\\|particles.ring\\|particles.text\\|lights.add\\|lights.ambient\\|lights.tint\\|game.flash\\|r.glowDisc\\|r.groundRing\\|r.groundDisc\\|r.decal\\|px.blend\\|px.ell\\b\\|px.ell(\" API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-330 | head -24","description":"Look up particles, lights and decal APIs"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VpuUnq81qdrWuizioexoCm","type":"tool_result","content":"197:- `px.blend(g, a, mode, fn)`: draw fn() at alpha a (stepped, like PS1 hardware) with a blend mode: 'normal', 'add', 'multiply', 'screen' (E.style.trans = 'dither' dithers instead)\n202:- `px.ell(g, cx, cy, rx, ry, c)`: a filled ellipse\n366:- `game.lights.add(x, y, z, radius, intensity = 1, o)` †: radius in world units; intensity ~0.5..1.5. opts: { color: '#ffaa55' (both lightings), shadow: true (GPU lighting: walls and casters block it) }\n372:- `game.lights.ambient = .15` †: how lit unlit places are, 0 (black) .. 1\n381:- `game.lights.tint = .32` †: how strongly lights add their own color, 0..1\n386:- `game.particles.add(p)`: add one particle { x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, life, max (seconds), g (gravity, > 0 pulls down), drag, bounce (0..1), kind: 'dust' | 'spark' | 'bit' | 'ember' | 'ring' | 'text', color, size }; returns it, or null when full\n387:- `game.particles.bits(x, y, z, n, colors)`: n pieces of debris that fly, fall and bounce (colors: a list to pick from)\n389:- `game.particles.dust(x, y, z, n, o = {})`: n puffs of dust from (x, y, z) that drift and fade. o: { speed: 30, color, size }\n392:- `game.particles.glints(x, y, z, n = 5, color = '#fff6c0', spread = 10)`: twinkling star glints for magic, treasure and pickups\n394:- `game.particles.ring(x, y, r0, r1, color, dur = .35, z = 0)`: a ring on the ground growing from radius r0 to r1 over dur seconds (shockwaves, landings)\n397:- `game.particles.text(x, y, z, text, color = '#fff2c4', o = {})`: floating number or word: text(x, y, z, '12', color, { scale: 2, bounce: true }) (bounce: lands and holds, Final Fantasy style)\n418:- `r.decal(fn, o)`: draw on the floor before the queue. opts.emissive (0..1) makes it glow under GPU lighting\n419:- `r.glowDisc(g, cx, cy, rad, color, a)`: glow halo from a cache: additive light rings (alpha style) or a dithered disc (dither style). a = 0..1 strength\n421:- `r.groundDisc(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a dithered disc lying on the ground (radius in world units, z its height): shadows, auras, area attacks\n423:- `r.groundRing(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a ring lying on the ground (radius in world units)\n475:- `game.enableGPU(o = {})` †: turn on WebGPU lighting: where it can't draw (no WebGPU, a side view) the canvas lighting stands in, with its own ambient (game.lights.ambient) and the same lights. opts: { map, bands, ambient, fallback, ... }\n478:- `game.flash(color = '#ffffff', seconds = .12, strength = 1)`: flash the whole screen with a color for `seconds` (dithered fade out): hits, explosions, lightning. Shorter when reduceMotion, dimmer by the player's settings.flashes\n531:- `game.lights` †: canvas lighting (lights.enabled, lights.add in draw)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8aedb0d-fc32-4598-b2c3-8a34e0c85184","uuid":"69a0c2ec-e347-4f33-b39f-662ce1d6ee52","timestamp":"2026-11-04T06:19:56.890Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"197:- `px.blend(g, a, mode, fn)`: draw fn() at alpha a (stepped, like PS1 hardware) with a blend mode: 'normal', 'add', 'multiply', 'screen' (E.style.trans = 'dither' dithers instead)\n202:- `px.ell(g, cx, cy, rx, ry, c)`: a filled ellipse\n366:- `game.lights.add(x, y, z, radius, intensity = 1, o)` †: radius in world units; intensity ~0.5..1.5. opts: { color: '#ffaa55' (both lightings), shadow: true (GPU lighting: walls and casters block it) }\n372:- `game.lights.ambient = .15` †: how lit unlit places are, 0 (black) .. 1\n381:- `game.lights.tint = .32` †: how strongly lights add their own color, 0..1\n386:- `game.particles.add(p)`: add one particle { x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, life, max (seconds), g (gravity, > 0 pulls down), drag, bounce (0..1), kind: 'dust' | 'spark' | 'bit' | 'ember' | 'ring' | 'text', color, size }; returns it, or null when full\n387:- `game.particles.bits(x, y, z, n, colors)`: n pieces of debris that fly, fall and bounce (colors: a list to pick from)\n389:- `game.particles.dust(x, y, z, n, o = {})`: n puffs of dust from (x, y, z) that drift and fade. o: { speed: 30, color, size }\n392:- `game.particles.glints(x, y, z, n = 5, color = '#fff6c0', spread = 10)`: twinkling star glints for magic, treasure and pickups\n394:- `game.particles.ring(x, y, r0, r1, color, dur = .35, z = 0)`: a ring on the ground growing from radius r0 to r1 over dur seconds (shockwaves, landings)\n397:- `game.particles.text(x, y, z, text, color = '#fff2c4', o = {})`: floating number or word: text(x, y, z, '12', color, { scale: 2, bounce: true }) (bounce: lands and holds, Final Fantasy style)\n418:- `r.decal(fn, o)`: draw on the floor before the queue. opts.emissive (0..1) makes it glow under GPU lighting\n419:- `r.glowDisc(g, cx, cy, rad, color, a)`: glow halo from a cache: additive light rings (alpha style) or a dithered disc (dither style). a = 0..1 strength\n421:- `r.groundDisc(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a dithered disc lying on the ground (radius in world units, z its height): shadows, auras, area attacks\n423:- `r.groundRing(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a ring lying on the ground (radius in world units)\n475:- `game.enableGPU(o = {})` †: turn on WebGPU lighting: where it can't draw (no WebGPU, a side view) the canvas lighting stands in, with its own ambient (game.lights.ambient) and the same lights. opts: { map, bands, ambient, fallback, ... }\n478:- `game.flash(color = '#ffffff', seconds = .12, strength = 1)`: flash the whole screen with a color for `seconds` (dithered fade out): hits, explosions, lightning. Shorter when reduceMotion, dimmer by the player's settings.flashes\n531:- `game.lights` †: canvas lighting (lights.enabled, lights.add in draw)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VpuUnq81qdrWuizioexoCm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
