{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JvccYmcFhdPZK3mYzwzXHa","type":"tool_result","content":"1056:- `game.audio.layer(track, vol = 1, fade = .5)` †: a track's volume as the song plays, 0..1, faded over fade seconds: layers of one song (the chase's drums in when the guards see you, out when they lose you). track: its index in song.tracks, or its name\n1057:- `game.audio.music(song, o = {})`: Loop a song (or play once with { loop: false }). song = { bpm: 120, steps: 4, tracks: [ { wave: 'square', vol: .2, notes: 'C5 - E5 - G5 - . . | ...' }, one token per step { wave: 'triangle', notes: 'C3 . C3 . G2 . G2 .' }, { wave: 'drums', notes: 'k . h . s . h . k k h . s . h .' } ] } tokens: C4 F#3 Bb2 = note, '-' holds the previous note, '.' = rest, '|' \n1059:- `game.audio.onBeat(fn)` †: call fn(beat, pos) on the update step of each beat of whatever music plays (a dancer's step, a light's pulse). Returns { cancel() }\n1060:- `game.audio.pos` †: where the music is, on the game's clock (headless too): { t: seconds since it started, step (from 0, counting on as it loops), beat, bar (four beats), at (the step in its loop), loop (times round), bpm, layers (each track's volume), playing }\n1064:- `game.audio.sting(song, o = {})` †: play a short song once over the music (a goal's jingle): o.at 'now', 'beat' or 'bar' (on the music's next beat or bar), o.duck (the music's volume under it, .4)\n1066:- `game.audio.tempo(bpm)` †: change the music's tempo as it plays (hurry up!): where it is stays, the steps after come at the new bpm","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8aedb0d-fc32-4598-b2c3-8a34e0c85184","uuid":"e237251d-30f5-40e8-9200-821fc7ebb6ca","timestamp":"2026-11-04T06:52:13.359Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1056:- `game.audio.layer(track, vol = 1, fade = .5)` †: a track's volume as the song plays, 0..1, faded over fade seconds: layers of one song (the chase's drums in when the guards see you, out when they lose you). track: its index in song.tracks, or its name\n1057:- `game.audio.music(song, o = {})`: Loop a song (or play once with { loop: false }). song = { bpm: 120, steps: 4, tracks: [ { wave: 'square', vol: .2, notes: 'C5 - E5 - G5 - . . | ...' }, one token per step { wave: 'triangle', notes: 'C3 . C3 . G2 . G2 .' }, { wave: 'drums', notes: 'k . h . s . h . k k h . s . h .' } ] } tokens: C4 F#3 Bb2 = note, '-' holds the previous note, '.' = rest, '|' \n1059:- `game.audio.onBeat(fn)` †: call fn(beat, pos) on the update step of each beat of whatever music plays (a dancer's step, a light's pulse). Returns { cancel() }\n1060:- `game.audio.pos` †: where the music is, on the game's clock (headless too): { t: seconds since it started, step (from 0, counting on as it loops), beat, bar (four beats), at (the step in its loop), loop (times round), bpm, layers (each track's volume), playing }\n1064:- `game.audio.sting(song, o = {})` †: play a short song once over the music (a goal's jingle): o.at 'now', 'beat' or 'bar' (on the music's next beat or bar), o.duck (the music's volume under it, .4)\n1066:- `game.audio.tempo(bpm)` †: change the music's tempo as it plays (hurry up!): where it is stays, the steps after come at the new bpm","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JvccYmcFhdPZK3mYzwzXHa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
