2p, k2v] = f(ad(p, k1p, h / 2), ad(v, k1v, h / 2)), [k3p, k3v] = f(ad(p, k2p, h / 2), ad(v, k2v, h / 2)), [k4p, k4v] = f(ad(p, k3p, h), ad(v, k3v, h)); p = p.map((x, i) => x + h / 6 * (k1p[i] + 2 * k2p[i] + 2 * k3p[i] + k4p[i])); v = v.map((x, i) => x + h / 6 * (k1v[i] + 2 * k2v[i] + 2 * k3v[i] + k4v[i])); }; const q = B.at(L, i * dt); worst = Math.max(worst, Math.hypot(q[0] - p[0], q[1] - p[1], q[2] - p[2])); }","   t.ok('closed form matches integration within .01 over 3 s', worst < .01, worst.toFixed(4));","   for (const T of [.6, 1, 1.4]) { const from = [250, 200, 30], to = [420, 270, 0], vv = B.aim(from, to, T), L2 = B.make(0, from, vv), q = B.at(L2, T); t.ok('aim lands within .5 at T=' + T, Math.hypot(q[0] - to[0], q[1] - to[1], q[2] - to[2]) < .5); }","   const L3 = B.make(0, [300, 240, 18], B.aim([300, 240, 18], [330, 240, 40], 1.05)), th = B.timeAtHeight(L3, 40);"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-225453__x8def6b/work/AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-225453/test/suites/ball.test.mjs"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TMyGm5TGqnaQ1rrmJSyvKm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
