` once, then set `rig.mocap` and `rig.mocapW` each step. I'll drive clips from the existing move state so celebrations, emotes, dances and idles all pick them up, keeping IK as the fallback.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2413,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":742783,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":2413},\"output_tokens\":7,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"7b48fecc-086c-4274-afae-e17752649adf\",\"uuid\":\"1c519d13-47fe-4635-95f9-f7d091efca70\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T07:32:23.824Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011CghVrALCyrMGtKR8rhdgk\",\"narration_block_indexes\":[0],\"thinking_duration_ms\":1,\"thinking_display\":\"updates\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CghVrAmFAJz1Dv9E6wi1z\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01YYUFmiRzJRMSnfaSemtcAc\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-231145__x8def6b/work/AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-231145; python3 - <<'EOF'\\np='src/15-anim.js'; s=open(p).read()\\ns=s.replace(\\\"  hips: null, wave: null, cheer: null, bow: null, nod: null, dance: null, backflip: null, shrug: u => [[2, -3.2, 18], [2, 3.2, 18]], lookback: null, sit: null, victory: null, sunbathe: null\\\",\\n\\\"  hips: null, wave: null, cheer: null, sit: null, victory: null, sunbathe: null, shrug: u => [[2, -3.2, 18], [2, 3.2, 18]],\\\\n  // moves a motion clip plays (the arms are left to it)\\\\n  bow: () => [null, null], nod: () => [null, null], dance: () =>