to the real game, Sonny lines missing caps), and the stub check is a keyword regex. The final reply also still discusses the island map and rally length as points that had to be re-checked. The feature requirement is therefore not clearly met.\\\\\\\"}]},\\\\\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"session_id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"7b48fecc-086c-4274-afae-e17752649adf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uuid\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0f81e665-1968-4697-87a0-4ad42e891652\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-11-04T07:46:28.831Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"isSynthetic\\\\\\\":true}\\\",\\\"+{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"system\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"subtype\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"thinking_tokens\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"estimated_tokens\\\\\\\":50,\\\\\\\"estimated_tokens_delta\\\\\\\":50,\\\\\\\"session_id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"7b48fecc-086c-4274-afae-e17752649adf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uuid\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"d98cc158-ac1b-41b6-ab2d-1aa3fbeea12e\\\\\\\"}\\\",\\\"+{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"system\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"subtype\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"thinking_tokens\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"estimated_tokens\\\\\\\":100,\\\\\\\"estimated_tokens_delta\\\\\\\":50,\\\\\\\"session_id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"7b48fecc-086c-4274-afae-e17752649adf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uuid\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"8e187a5a-2e31-4784-acaf-d0a73b6e246e\\\\\\\"}\\\",\\\"+{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"system\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"subtype\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"thinking_tokens\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"estimated_tokens\\\\\\\":345,\\\\\\\"estimated_tokens_delta\\\\\\\":245,\\\\\\\"session_id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"7b48fecc-086c-4274-afae-e17752649adf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uuid\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"fa7efde3-913e-44d2-88f3-914649562e1e\\\\\\\"}\\\",\\\"+{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"model\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"claude-opus-5-5\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"msg_011CghWxSu8kZAMvFuZh38Z7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"role\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"assistant\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"thinking\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"thinking\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sign