{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghZ8doF4yv9v2WS1sQmP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XrX4f2BooMDY5A4w5b4G2B","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-225453__x8def6b/work/AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-225453/ENGINE-CHANGES.md","old_string":"| 8 | `E.onStep(fn)`: a hook on every step's input pass, through fades and pauses | the attract must end on any input, even during a scene transition | attract |\n","new_string":"| 8 | `E.onStep(fn)`: a hook on every step's input pass, through fades and pauses | the attract must end on any input, even during a scene transition | attract |\n| 9 | `Input.halfKeys`: each action takes the next half-keyboard button that no earlier action in the preset already holds | a menu preset's `alt` and `extra` were given F and G (left half), the keys `confirm` and `cancel` already use, so Outfit and Ready were the same key in the Beach Match lobby. Gameplay presets don't change: their play buttons come before confirm, and sharing F there is intended | pads (a clash check on both halves) |\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2567,"cache_read_input_tokens":155797,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2567},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8aedb0d-fc32-4598-b2c3-8a34e0c85184","uuid":"20e79b7d-0168-499f-b2c5-dd1191aaaca1","timestamp":"2026-11-04T08:15:07.474Z","request_id":"req_011CghZ8dVPggAmcwcBboxnf","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01XrX4f2BooMDY5A4w5b4G2B":{"file_path":"/home/micha/